---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updatedAt = '9 July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie policy | marmibas.dev"
  description="Information about technical cookies and analytics cookies on marmibas.dev."
  noindex
>
  <article class="legal-page" aria-labelledby="cookie-policy-title">
    <p class="legal-page__eyebrow font-mono">Privacy</p>
    <h1 id="cookie-policy-title" class="legal-page__title font-display">Cookie policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-page__updated">Last updated: {updatedAt}</p>

    <div class="legal-page__content">
      <section>
        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <p>
          This website may use necessary technical storage to remember your analytics cookie choice.
          Analytics cookies are only enabled if you give consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Technical or necessary cookies</h2>
        <p>
          No first-party technical cookies required for browsing the site have been identified. Your
          analytics choice is stored in the browser's local storage under the key
          <code>marmibas:analytics-consent</code>, so the site does not ask again on every visit.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Analytics cookies</h2>
        <p>
          If you accept, this website loads Google Analytics 4 with measurement ID
          <code>G-9WPZK36B04</code>. Google Analytics may create cookies such as <code>_ga</code> and
          related cookies to distinguish visits and prepare aggregated usage statistics.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you reject, the analytics script is not loaded and these analytics cookies are not created
          by this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How to change your choice</h2>
        <p>
          You can revoke or change your choice by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.
          After local data for marmibas.dev is removed, the banner will appear again on your next visit.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 760px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem);
  }

  .legal-page__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-300);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wider);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-page__title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-0);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
  }

  .legal-page__updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .legal-page__content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .legal-page__content section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-page__content h2 {
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
  }

  .legal-page__content p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-page__content code {
    color: var(--accent-300);
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }
</style>
